<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n56912" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κερουλκός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλκω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drawing</i> a plough <i>by the horns</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>drawing a bow of horn</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τρῶες</span>] <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				859
			</span></i> (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of the bow itself, because <i>tipped with horn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόξα κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					268
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. κάλως,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεραιοῦχος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
